','D) const_cast','B',1,'2026-03-14 09:12:58'),(3752,65,26,0,'Composition means:','A) IS-A relationship','B) HAS-A relationship','C) CAN-A relationship','D) NONE','B',1,'2026-03-14 09:12:58'),(3753,65,26,0,'Inheritance represents:','A) HAS-A','B) USES-A','C) IS-A','D) CONTAINS-A','C',1,'2026-03-14 09:12:58'),(3754,65,26,0,'Composition is preferred when:','A) Code reuse','B) Tight coupling','C) Loose coupling','D) Multiple inheritance','C',1,'2026-03-14 09:12:58'),(3755,65,26,0,'Which is tighter coupling?','A) Composition','B) Inheritance','C) Aggregation','D) Association','B',1,'2026-03-14 09:12:58'),(3756,65,26,0,'Which supports runtime polymorphism?','A) Function overloading','B) Templates','C) Virtual functions','D) Inline functions','C',1,'2026-03-14 09:12:58'),(3757,65,26,0,'Function overloading supports:','A) Runtime polymorphism','B) Compile time polymorphism','C) Late binding','D) Dynamic binding','B',1,'2026-03-14 09:12:59'),(3758,65,26,0,'A base class pointer can access:','A) Only derived members','B) Only base members','C) All members','D) None','B',1,'2026-03-14 09:12:59'),(3759,65,26,0,'Which function cannot be virtual?','A) Destructor','B) Constructor','C) Member function','D) Inline function','B',1,'2026-03-14 09:12:59'),(3760,65,26,0,'Which function is automatically virtual?','A) Constructor','B) Destructor','C) Inline','D) Static','B',1,'2026-03-14 09:12:59'),(3761,65,26,0,'Friend functions:','A) Are inherited','B) Are not inherited','C) Must be virtual','D) Cannot access private','B',1,'2026-03-14 09:12:59'),(3762,65,26,0,'Multiple inheritance may cause:','A) Overloading','B) Diamond problem','C) Encapsulation','D) Static binding','B',1,'2026-03-14 09:12:59'),(3763,65,26,0,'Diamond problem is solved using:','A) static','B) inline','C) virtual base class','D) friend','C',1,'2026-03-14 09:12:59'),(3764,65,26,0,'Which supports polymorphism?','A) Overloading','B) Overriding','C) Both','D) None','C',1,'2026-03-14 09:12:59'),(3765,65,26,0,'Best practice 